WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.268
"I have a surprise," said Mr. Scary.

2
00:00:06.269 --> 00:00:10.178
I held my breath and kept my eyes closed.

3
00:00:10.179 --> 00:00:14.421
I was terrified to hear what Mr. Scary was about to say.

4
00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:19.200
"I'm glad my vegetables disappeared," said Mr. Scary.

5
00:00:19.201 --> 00:00:22.019
"What?" My eyes flew open.

6
00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.850
"You're glad they disappeared?"

7
00:00:24.851 --> 00:00:28.248
Mr. Chen looked as surprised as I was.

8
00:00:28.249 --> 00:00:31.115
"You're glad?" he echoed.

9
00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:34.483
"Yes." Mr. Scary smiled at him.

10
00:00:34.484 --> 00:00:38.323
"Because your magic show was terrific."

11
00:00:38.324 --> 00:00:42.043
I gave Josh, Jenny, and Molly a thumbs-up.

12
00:00:42.044 --> 00:00:44.516
Caswell was beaming.

13
00:00:44.517 --> 00:00:48.286
"I did something right!" he blurted out.

14
00:00:48.287 --> 00:00:51.986
"No, Caswell," said Molly sternly.

15
00:00:51.987 --> 00:00:54.614
"Taking the vegetables was very wrong.

16
00:00:54.615 --> 00:00:57.556
It was stealing."

17
00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:03.990
"I admit I was worried about the magic show at first," Mr. Scary told Mr. Chen.

18
00:01:03.991 --> 00:01:06.298
"I wasn't sure the audience would like it.

19
00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.604
But you were great!"

20
00:01:08.605 --> 00:01:12.126
"Thank you," said Mr. Chen.

21
00:01:12.127 --> 00:01:16.550
"The last trick was the best," Mr. Scary went on.

22
00:01:16.551 --> 00:01:21.846
"Having the audience search for Bunch was a brilliant idea!"

23
00:01:21.847 --> 00:01:25.471
Mr. Chen winked at me, and I felt proud.

24
00:01:25.472 --> 00:01:30.286
That part of the magic trick had been my idea.

25
00:01:30.287 --> 00:01:36.821
"Your magic show was so good that I'd like to offer you a job," said Mr. Scary.

26
00:01:36.822 --> 00:01:39.922
"A job?" said Mr. Chen.

27
00:01:39.923 --> 00:01:46.947
"Yes. I'd like you to work as a magician here at the hotel," Mr. Scary explained.

28
00:01:46.948 --> 00:01:49.426
Josh glanced at his dad.

29
00:01:49.427 --> 00:01:53.353
"But what about our apartment in the city?" he asked.

30
00:01:53.354 --> 00:01:58.064
"Yes, we don't want to leave home," added Jenny.

31
00:01:58.065 --> 00:02:03.396
"I can't imagine our apartment building without Josh and Jenny!" I said.

32
00:02:03.397 --> 00:02:08.413
"New people would move into Josh and Jenny's old apartment," said Molly.

33
00:02:08.414 --> 00:02:10.961
"It wouldn't be the same."

34
00:02:10.962 --> 00:02:14.553
"Just a moment, everyone," said Mr. Chen.

35
00:02:14.554 --> 00:02:19.188
"Let's hear what Mr. Scary has to say."

36
00:02:19.189 --> 00:02:23.975
"You won't have to move," Mr. Scary said to Josh and Jenny.

37
00:02:23.976 --> 00:02:26.469
"Your dad can work here on weekends.

38
00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:29.834
You kids can come too," he added.

39
00:02:29.835 --> 00:02:32.235
"And Bunch of course."

40
00:02:32.236 --> 00:02:35.006
"Ruff!" barked Bunch.

41
00:02:35.007 --> 00:02:39.757
Then he lay down and growled at the red curtains.

42
00:02:39.758 --> 00:02:42.585
Jenny leaned over and whispered to me.

43
00:02:42.586 --> 00:02:48.915
"Maybe next time we can get a room without red curtains."

44
00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:51.465
Mr. Scary looked at Mr. Chen.

45
00:02:51.466 --> 00:02:54.033
"Well?" he said.

46
00:02:54.034 --> 00:02:56.448
"Would you like the job?"

47
00:02:56.449 --> 00:02:59.073
Mr. Chen smiled widely.

48
00:02:59.074 --> 00:03:02.982
"I would love to work here," he said.

49
00:03:02.983 --> 00:03:05.801
"Oh boy!" shouted Josh.

50
00:03:05.802 --> 00:03:08.413
"We'll have so much fun!"

51
00:03:08.414 --> 00:03:12.001
"Horseback riding!" said Molly.

52
00:03:12.002 --> 00:03:15.839
"Treasure hunting!" added Caswell.

53
00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.093
"Fishing!" I said.

54
00:03:19.094 --> 00:03:21.988
"Good," said Mr. Scary.

55
00:03:21.989 --> 00:03:24.281
"Then it's all settled, Mr. Chen.

56
00:03:24.282 --> 00:03:27.414
You can start working next weekend."

57
00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:32.481
Before Mr. Scary left, he tossed the rotten vegetables in the trash.

58
00:03:32.482 --> 00:03:37.811
Then he let out a loud laugh.

59
00:03:37.812 --> 00:03:41.349
"That's actually very funny!" he said.

60
00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:45.578
"Hiding vegetables under the bed! Ha-ha!"

61
00:03:45.579 --> 00:03:49.763
We all started laughing too.

62
00:03:49.764 --> 00:03:57.699
Later that afternoon we got on the bus and headed home to the city.

63
00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:01.178
"What a weekend!" said Josh.

64
00:04:01.179 --> 00:04:07.073
I nodded. We'd had so much fun, and Mr. Chen had a new job.

65
00:04:07.074 --> 00:04:10.575
Now Josh and Jenny wouldn't have to move away.

66
00:04:10.576 --> 00:04:14.566
Mr. Chen said he would keep looking for a job in the city.

67
00:04:14.567 --> 00:04:19.020
But on the weekends we could go to Shadow Lake Lodge.

68
00:04:19.021 --> 00:04:22.769
I sat back on my seat and closed my eyes.

69
00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:27.465
I thought about what Josh had said to me before we left.

70
00:04:27.466 --> 00:04:33.234
"Iggy, can you invent something to help my dad find a job?" he had asked.

71
00:04:33.235 --> 00:04:35.709
"I don't know," I had said.

72
00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:39.141
"I'd have to be a real genius to do that."

73
00:04:39.142 --> 00:04:43.836
It turned out that I had invented something to help Mr. Chen get a new job:

74
00:04:43.837 --> 00:04:47.121
my rainbow trail pellets.

75
00:04:47.122 --> 00:04:53.761
So maybe I was a genius after all!

